<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00114">
	<title id="e00814">Adjusting the height up and down</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e00815">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e00816">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/OOV025019.eps" align="center" height="1.740in" placement="break" id="e00817"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p>To raise the headrest, pull it up to the desired position (1).</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>To lower the headrest, push and hold the release button (2) on the headrest support and lower the headrest to the desired position (3).</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
</concept>